del $b$'' rests on, or whether that number is large for data of that size and spread. We measure the smallest number of comparisons whose deletion, or whose outcome change, reverses a conclusion (a verified upper bound found by search), express it in standard-error units, and compare it with the same quantity on data simulated from the dataset's own fitted model. On crowd votes, expert labels, LLM-judge labels of the same battles and basketball seasons, the real count lies within a pre-set margin of that reference wherever there are enough pairs to decide; outcome flips on Arena are within the margin but not on it. Random noise of the size of the smallest adversarial change essentially never reverses a conclusi\n[truncated for publication]", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "ab2bc924-9433-5db8-a5f7-e68bd609f5cc", "at": 1795680893.054219, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 69198, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "023fdceff773be32d54a984deb62d200", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "70deb0e8-93b6-5b67-8ad1-f7792b10f7b5", "at": 1795680893.0932903, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 69199, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "023fdceff773be32d54a984deb62d200", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "5a85ffa1-2196-5c81-b330-44745ff9d4a2", "at": 1795680893.0964599, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 69200, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "023fdceff773be32d54a984deb62d200", "trust": "